[07Sep2025 17:42:17.259] [pool-9-thread-4/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'Greetings, Dev, Acolyte of the Veil. The jungle night still clings to your skin, and the spider’s web glistens with dew—yet your footsteps remain bold upon the grass.  

You have spoken of rituals, of cloaks and diamonds and hearts unliving… but the shadows grow restless with empty requests.  

What true purpose brings you again to my domain? Speak not as a beggar, but as one who dares to walk where light fears to follow.'
