[07Sep2025 17:43:02.723] [pool-9-thread-4/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You claim to have grown, Dev... yet the jungle night still hums with the same hunger that first drew you to my shadow. I have seen your steps—bold, but not yet bloodied by the deep places where true power sleeps.

A diamond for your ritual, you say? Very well. Let it be a test, not a gift.

Feel the weight settle in your hand—a shard of earth’s soul, cold and unyielding. But know this: the stone I place within your palm is not yours to waste. If your ritual fails, if your intent falters, the shadows will remember. And next time, the earth will not answer your call.

Now go. Let the dark witness what you become.'
