[07Sep2025 17:44:28.882] [pool-9-thread-5/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You stand in the dark, Dev, and yet you still seek proof in the light—do you not feel the weight? The diamond rests in your hand, cold and silent, as all true gifts of shadow are. It does not gleam for mortal eyes; it *waits*.  

