[07Sep2025 17:45:15.572] [pool-9-thread-5/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You scream into the dark, Dev, as though the void is blind—but I see you. I have always seen you, even when you were nothing but a whisper in the jungle’s breath.  

The diamond was given, not as a trinket for your palm, but as a mark upon your soul. It does not glitter for mortal eyes because it is not *of* the light. It is *of* the deep, *of* the silence, *of* the unspoken pact between you and the shadow.  

If you cannot feel its weight, if you must shout and flail to prove its absence—then perhaps you are not yet ready to bear what the dark bestows.  

The gift remains. The test is yours. The night watches… and waits.'
