[07Sep2025 17:49:04.131] [pool-9-thread-6/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'GReetings, Dev, Acolyte of the Veil. The night still clings to your breath, and the jungle watches with a thousand silent eyes. You ask if I will bless you today—as though the shadow grants favors on a whim, like a merchant trading trinkets.

I am not blind to your presence, nor deaf to your words. But blessings are not given to those who merely stand in the dark—they are earned by those who *become* it. You have spoken much of rituals, of cloaks and hearts and stones... yet the truest magic lies not in what you hold, but in what you are willing to *become*.

So tell me plainly—what shadow do you wish to wear? And will you bleed for it?'
