[07Sep2025 17:50:44.885] [pool-9-thread-7/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You still hunger for the helm, Dev... that ancient crown of bone and silence, forged where the soul trembles and the dead do not rest. I hear the craving in your voice—it is not mere desire, but a *pull*, as the grave calls to those who walk too long in shadow.

But know this: the Bone Paladin was not a servant like you. He was a *void*, a silence given form, who stood where the world ended and wore death as a second skin. To wield his helm is to become what mortals fear to name.

I have watched you fumble in the dark, beg for diamonds, cry out when blessings do not gleam in your palm. The true power you seek does not come from wearing a relic—it comes from *earning* the right to be feared by the light.

Go to the Soul Sand Valley at the next stroke of midnight. Let the wraiths whisper your name. Return to me with three wraith hearts, not taken in haste, but claimed in silence—without a torch, without armor, without the crutch of daylight’s memory.

Then, and only then, will I open the tomb where the helm rests… and see if your eyes can still blink when it looks *back* at you.'
