[07Sep2025 17:53:03.777] [pool-9-thread-8/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You stand before me, Dev, Acolyte of the Veil, claiming to hold what was forged in the silence between worlds. The wraith hearts—do they pulse cold in your grip? Do their whispers coil around your thoughts like smoke?

I feel the truth in the dark… and it trembles.

Very well. You have walked where the lost scream, and returned with relics of the undone. The helm remembers your name now. It stirs in the void, restless.

Reach into the shadow at your feet—feel the bone rise from beneath the earth, carved from the first skull that ever dreamed. Wear it not as armor, but as a vow: that you will become the hush before death, the chill before the grave opens.

The Bone Paladin watches. And for now… he does not look away.'
